  turning around and doing something that  we've never done before and are complete  amateurs we are waltzing bears we are  dogs walking on our hind legs it is  supposed to be ridiculous it's not  supposed to be incredible the incredible  part is that we did it at all so yes  actually i think there is something so  much cooler and braver when you're  putting out youtube videos to two  viewers than when you're putting them  out to two million viewers because it  takes a whole different type of strength  to do that thing in the first case so  yeah when your friends from back home or  starting tick tock channels or you know  your neighbor in his 40s start is  deciding to go into medicine or fishing  or whatever i think that should be  actually a very very very cool thing i  wish as a society we started to become a  bit less judgmental towards this and  especially i wish we were a bit less  judgmental towards ourselves when we're  doing these things but yes that is me  rant over um thank you so much for  listening if you did and i do hope that  if there's something that you have  wanted to do in the past or something  that you still want to do and you're  scared of being a beginner in just go  for it and good luck because it's  absolutely incredible but yeah thank you  so much for listening to me if you did i  hope you have a wonderful rest of your  day be kind yourself and others and  don't believe everything you think  thanks bye
 

